{"id":"87a029d02ac0983e","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-dce-bounded-variation.md","title":"D.c.e. Reals and Bounded Variation","display":"thm-dce-bounded-variation — D.c.e. Reals and Bounded Variation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-dce-bounded-variation","aliases":["43-thm-dce-bounded-variation"],"display":"thm-dce-bounded-variation — D.c.e. Reals and Bounded Variation","depends_on":["[[43-df-dce-real]]","[[43-df-bounded-variation-approximation]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Lemma 8.5.2","source_printed_pages":"152","source_pdf_pages":"172","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-dce-bounded-variation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-dce-bounded-variation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dce-bounded-variation — D.c.e. Reals and Bounded Variation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2485b90ec527f97e\" href=\"?note=2485b90ec527f97e\" title=\"43-df-dce-real\">43-df-dce-real</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d2cf6bb66fd8df63\" href=\"?note=d2cf6bb66fd8df63\" title=\"43-df-bounded-variation-approximation\">43-df-bounded-variation-approximation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 8.5.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"152"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"172"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DCEReal}\">\\(\\mathrm{DCEReal}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2485b90ec527f97e\" href=\"?note=2485b90ec527f97e\" title=\"43-df-dce-real\">43-df-dce-real</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BVApprox}\">\\(\\operatorname{BVApprox}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d2cf6bb66fd8df63\" href=\"?note=d2cf6bb66fd8df63\" title=\"43-df-bounded-variation-approximation\">43-df-bounded-variation-approximation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\iff\\exists q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\operatorname{BVApprox}(q,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\iff\\exists q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\operatorname{BVApprox}(q,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=y-z\">\\(x=y-z\\)</span>，取可计算递增有理近似 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_s,z_s\">\\(y_s,z_s\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_s=y_s-z_s\">\\(q_s=y_s-z_s\\)</span>，且总变差至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(y-y_0)+(z-z_0)\">\\((y-y_0)+(z-z_0)\\)</span>。反向令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_s=q_0+\\sum_{j&lt;s}\\max(q_{j+1}-q_j,0)\">\\(y_s=q_0+\\sum_{j&lt;s}\\max(q_{j+1}-q_j,0)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_s=\\sum_{j&lt;s}\\max(q_j-q_{j+1},0)\">\\(z_s=\\sum_{j&lt;s}\\max(q_j-q_{j+1},0)\\)</span>。二者可计算递增且由有限总变差界有有限极限，并恒有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_s=y_s-z_s\">\\(q_s=y_s-z_s\\)</span>。保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_0\">\\(q_0\\)</span> 项避免初值非零时丢失常数。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Lemma 8.5.2；印刷页 152，PDF 页 172。本轮核对范围及证明限制如上。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-dce-real","status":"resolved","id":"2485b90ec527f97e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-dce-real]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-bounded-variation-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"d2cf6bb66fd8df63","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-bounded-variation-approximation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-dce-real","status":"resolved","id":"2485b90ec527f97e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-dce-real]]，$\\operatorname{BVApprox}$ 采用 [[43-df-bounded-variation-approximation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-bounded-variation-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"d2cf6bb66fd8df63","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{DCEReal}$ 采用 [[43-df-dce-real]]，$\\operatorname{BVApprox}$ 采用 [[43-df-bounded-variation-approximation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DCEReal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BVApprox}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DCEReal}(x)\\iff\\exists q:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\operatorname{BVApprox}(q,x).","display":true},{"tex":"x=y-z","display":false},{"tex":"y_s,z_s","display":false},{"tex":"q_s=y_s-z_s","display":false},{"tex":"(y-y_0)+(z-z_0)","display":false},{"tex":"y_s=q_0+\\sum_{j<s}\\max(q_{j+1}-q_j,0)","display":false},{"tex":"z_s=\\sum_{j<s}\\max(q_j-q_{j+1},0)","display":false},{"tex":"q_s=y_s-z_s","display":false},{"tex":"q_0","display":false}],"bytes":1493,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-dce-bounded-variation]] — D.c.e. Reals and Bounded Variation"},{"id":"192242ff132fc1ff","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["2485b90ec527f97e","d2cf6bb66fd8df63"]}